{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}"
}

### 86. Book the same slot again (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}"
}

### 87. Edit a booked slot (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}
