{
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T15:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T17:00:00Z"
}

### 88. Student: my upcoming sessions (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sessions/student
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 89. Tutor: my upcoming sessions (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sessions/tutor
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}

### 90. Cancel the session (200 { message }); the slot becomes free
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 91. Cancel again (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 92. Delete the (now free) slot (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}

### 93. Student reports a tutor (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportedType": "TUTOR",
  "reportedId": "{{tutorId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "reason": "Tutor did not show up"
}

### 94. List all reports (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 95. Filter by status (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/filter/status?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 96. Reports against an account (200)
