{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "adminResolutionNotes": "Duplicate"
}

### 100. Log out (200 { message })
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 101. Use the revoked token (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
